# ai-minions orchestrator (manual integration only)

**Do not enable `alwaysApply`.** This rule must stay off for every-chat use.

Activation of ai-minions is **not** this file and **not** `MODE:`/`FLOW:` text. Only the product CLI sets `AI_MINIONS_ACTIVE=1` + `AI_MINIONS_RUN_ID` (see `docs/orchestrator/activation.md`).

When the user explicitly asks to work inside an **already active** ai-minions run, use the contract:

- `docs/orchestrator/agent-contract.md`
- `docs/orchestrator/mcp-task-examples.md`
- `docs/orchestrator/PATHS.md`

For normal Claude/Cursor work in this repository (including RAG design/implementation), ignore multi-role blocks, handoffs, and CERBERUS pipeline machinery.
